-prev\"><span><i class=\"flaticon-arrow-1\"></i></span></div>\r\n            <div class=\"banner-slider-control banner-slider-button-next\"><span><i class=\"flaticon-arrow-1\"></i></span> </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </section>\r\n    <!-- End Bnner Section -->\r\n\r\n    <section class=\"about-section-five\">\r\n        <div class=\"auto-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"sec-title text-center\">\r\n                <h2>Scholarship Schemes</h2>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"row\">\r\n                <div class=\"col-lg-6 image-column\">\r\n                    <div class=\"title-box\">\r\n                        <div class=\"sec-title mb-0\">\r\n                            <h5 style=\"text-align: ;\">\r\n                                <b style=\"color:#23854b;\">NLNG 2024 Undergraduate Scholarship Award for Nigerian Students</b><br><br>\r\n                                In line with its dedication to education and human capital development, NLNG invites applications from first year students in the 2024/2025 academic session for the 2024 Undergraduate Scholarship Award. \r\n                                This initiative is designed to support exceptional first-year students (in 2024/2025 academic session) in Nigerian Universities, equipping them with the resources to excel academically and contribute to national \r\n                                development.<br><br>\r\n                                NLNG is committed to fostering an inclusive scholarship programme and encourages applications from all eligible students, including Persons Living with Disabilities (PLWDs).\r\n                            </h5><br><br><br><br>\r\n                            <div class=\"link-btn\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://candidate.scholastica.ng/schemes/nlngugssn\" class=\"theme-btn\"><span>Apply</span></a></div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"col-lg-6 image-column\">\r\n                    <div class=\"title-box\">\r\n                        <div class=\"sec-title mb-0\">\r\n                            <h5 style=\"text-align: ;\">\r\n                                <b style=\"color:#23854b;\">2024 NLNG Undergraduate Scholarship Scheme For Host Communities</b><br><br>\r\n                                In commemoration of its 35/25th Anniversary (35 years of incorporation and 25 years of operational excellence), NLNG wishes to announce a special edition of the NLNG Undergraduate Scholarship Scheme - \r\n                                UGSS Special Edition for its Host Communities.<br><br>\r\n                                The UGSS Special Edition is designed to empower exceptional students from the Company's Host Communities by providing financial support necessary to complete their undergraduate studies at Nigerian public universities.<br><br>\r\n                                NLNG is dedicated to fostering an inclusive scholarship program and actively encourages applications from all eligible indigenes of its host communities, including Persons Living with Disabilities (PLWDs).\r\n                            </h5><br>\r\n                            <div class=\"link-btn\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://candidate.scholastica.ng/schemes/nlngugssh\" class=\"theme-btn\"><span>Apply</span></a></div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"col-lg-6 image-column\">\r\n                    <div class=\"title-box\">\r\n                        <div class=\"sec-title mb-0\">\r\n                            <h5 style=\"text-align: ;\">\r\n                                <b style=\"color:#23854b;\">2024 NLNG Postgraduate Scholarship Scheme</b><br><br>\r\n                                In commemoration of its 35/25th Anniversary (35 years of incorporation and 25 years of operational excellence), NLNG wishes to announce a special edition of the NLNG Post Graduate Scholarship Scheme \r\n                                PGSS Special Edition - for its Host Communities.<br><br>\r\n                                The PGSS Special Edition is designed to empower exceptional students from the Company's Host Communities by providing the financial support necessary to complete their postgraduate studies at \r\n                                recognized universities in the United Kingdom (UK).<br><br>\r\n                                NLNG is dedicated to fostering an inclusive scholarship program and actively encourages applications from all eligible indigenes of its Host Communities, including Persons Living with Disabilities (PLWDs).\r\n                            </h5><br>\r\n                            <div class=\"link-btn\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://candidate.scholastica.ng/schemes/nlngpgss\" class=\"theme-btn\"><span>Apply</span></a></div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </section>\r\n\r\n    <!--Main Footer-->\r\n       <!--End Main Footer-->\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"footer-bottom\">\r\n        <div class=\"auto-container\">\r\n            <div class=\"wrapper-box\">\r\n                <div class=\"row m-0 align-items-center justify-content-between\">\r\n                    <div class=\"copyright-text\">Copyright \u00a9 2026 <a href=\"#\"> NLNG.</a> All Rights Reserved.</div>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </div>    \r\n</div>\r\n<!--End pagewrapper-->\r\n\r\n<!--Scroll to top-->\r\n<div class=\"scroll-to-top scroll-to-target\" data-target=\"html\"><span class=\"flaticon-arrow-1\"></span></div>\r\n\r\n<script src=\"assets/js/jquery.js\"></script>\r\n<script src=\"assets/js/popper.min.js\"></script>\r\n<script src=\"assets/js/bootstrap.min.js\"></script>\r\n<script src=\"assets/js/bootstrap-select.min.js\"></script>\r\n<script src=\"assets/js/jquery.fa